{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DO U LIKE TO GROMP?! DO YOU LIKE TO STOMP!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>!!!gROMPsTOMPERS!!! </strong><br> ~<i>a physics-based action adventure game</i><br> <br> <br><strong>THIS GAME IS VERY MUCH A LABOR OF LOVE &lt;3</strong>  <br> <br> -- <br><u>A note on <i>the &quot;souls-like, souls-lie.&quot;</i></u><i>  </i> <br> <br>A lot of games claim the souls-like tag for marketability and visibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following is an express explanation as to why this game has this tag:<br><br><i>There is <strong>dodge rolling</strong>. There are <strong>i-frames</strong>. There is <strong>stamina</strong>.</i><br><br>And yet.... ALAS.<br><br>There is no &quot;lock-on mechanic.&quot;<br><br><strong>Instead: </strong>gROMPsTOMPERS has an experimental mixture of &quot;third-person shooter&quot; as well as &quot;souls-like&quot; mechanics. <br><br>Gameplay revolves around precise well-aimed movement, in conjunction with the standard challenge of dodge-rolling and attack spacing and timing.<br><br><i>Trying to get past a shield?</i>\u00a0-<strong>Aim past it.</strong><br><i>Trying to duck under an enemy attack?</i>\u00a0-<strong>GO UNDER IT.</strong> <br><i>Trying to [...literally anything]?</i>\u00a0-<strong>PHYSICS.</strong><br><br>So?<br>It's a souls-like AND a third-person shooter. <br> <br> <br>As such, it is strongly recommended that u only play <strong>gROMPsTOMPERS</strong> if you are <strong>good at videogames</strong>. <br> <br><strong><i><u>/// WARNING: DO NOT PLAY gROMPsTOMPERS IF YOU HATE FUN ///</u></i></strong> <br> <br> <br>-- <br> A final note:<br><br>THIS GAME DOES NOT COLLECT YOUR PERSONAL DATA. THAT'S GROSS AND BAD. Once you buy the game, you have a copy of it. You can treat it as if you bought a physical copy in the 90's.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4130940?t=1762967076","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com